I am standing outside the office.
There is a fruit cart on the street.
There are many fresh bananas on the cart.
I go near the cart.
I ask warmly, "Bhaiya, how much are the bananas?"
Bhaiya says, "Madam, sixty rupees a dozen."
I say, "I want half a dozen bananas."
Bhaiya gives me six bananas.
I take money out of my bag.
I give him thirty rupees.
I take the bananas.
I put them safely in my bag.
I smile and turn back.
Now I go inside the office.
I start my work again.
